      "description": "Current step uses semantic state, weight and an underline.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-stages\" aria-label=\"成长流程\"><button aria-current=\"step\">01 榜样与成长</button><button>02 晨间决策</button><button>03 接受任务</button></nav>",
