      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "b-quest-card",
      "description": "A selectable budget card; the selected border is compensated by padding.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-quest\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-cost\"><span>AI</span><span>45 分钟 / 3 格</span></span><h3>实现一个梯度小实验</h3><p>一个能运行、能解释的小作品。</p><span class=\"ds-foot\"><strong>+30 XP</strong><span class=\"ds-mark\">已入手牌</span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-quest{--bg:#f1edf4;--paper:#fffcff;--ink:#382640;--muted:#68566f;--accent:#654078;--soft:#e4d9eb;--line:#cbbcd1;--warm:#825317;--positive:#316747;font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--paper,#fffcff);border:1px solid var(--line,#cbbcd1);color:var(--ink,#382640);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:234px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease-out,border-color 160ms ease-out}.ds-quest[aria-pressed=true]{border:2px solid var(--accent,#654078);padding:19px;background:#f9f3fc}.ds-cost{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#68566f);margin-bottom:24px}.ds-quest h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.35;margin:0}.ds-quest p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted,#68566f);margin:11px 0 22px}.ds-foot{margin-top:auto;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:12px}.ds-foot strong{color:var(--accent,#654078)}.ds-mark{border:1px solid var(--line,#cbbcd1);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px}.ds-quest:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#654078);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-quest{transition:none}}"
