      "html": "<section class=\"ds-document\"><div class=\"ds-doc-title\"><h2>今天留下了什么</h2></div><article class=\"ds-folio\"><div class=\"ds-stamp\">已留记录<br>待完整验证</div><div><h3>实现一个梯度小实验</h3><p>这里等待你补充实际发生的事。</p></div></article></section>",
      "css": ".ds-document{--bg:#eaf0f4;--paper:#fff;--ink:#243c50;--muted:#50677a;--accent:#176552;--soft:#dceee5;--line:#bdced7;--warm:#865419;--positive:#176552;font-family:\"PingFang SC\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--paper,#fff);color:var(--ink,#243c50);border:1px solid var(--line,#bdced7);padding:30px;min-width:0;line-height:1.65}.ds-doc-title{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#bdced7);padding-bottom:20px;margin-bottom:20px;align-items:center}.ds-doc-title h2{margin:0;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.35}.ds-folio{display:grid;grid-template-columns:100px 1fr;gap:25px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#bdced7);padding:24px 0}.ds-stamp{align-self:start;border:1px dashed var(--line,#bdced7);border-radius:50%;width:88px;height:88px;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;color:var(--muted,#50677a);font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}.ds-folio h3{margin:0;font-size:17px;font-weight:650;line-height:1.35}.ds-folio p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#50677a);margin:8px 0 0}"
